# Dependencies and licences

This mod contains no file from the mods listed below. It is only compiled against their
classes, and calls them at runtime.

| Mod | Licence | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Applied Energistics 2 Unofficial Extended Life | LGPL v3 | terminal, container and ME network classes |
| PackagedAuto (TheLMiffy1111) | MIT | recipe and machine API |
| Mouse Tweaks (YaLTeR) | public interface | `IMTModGuiContainer2`, required at compile time because `AEBaseGui` implements it |

The file `src/api/java/yalter/mousetweaks/api/IMTModGuiContainer2.java` reproduces a public
interface, which its author intends to be bundled by the mods that depend on it.

The documentation in `docs/PACKAGEDAUTO-MODEL.md` quotes short excerpts of PackagedAuto,
under the MIT licence, as technical evidence.
